{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":511178,"ns":0,"title":"Beer tap","extract":"A beer tap is a valved device for controlling the release of beer. While the same hardware in other contexts may be called faucet, valve or spigot, the use of tap for beer is almost universal.","description":"Device for controlling the flow of beer into a vessel","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}